        "caption": "Meningioma cytology smear: characteristic cellular whorls and uniform oval nuclei with delicate chromatin and intranuclear pseudoinclusions.",
        "credit": "Jensflorian",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File%3AMeningioma_cytologie.jpg"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
